 "capa": "THE GROUND LIFTS HOUSES",
 "descripcion": "Frozen ground swells and lifts houses. That is why footings in cold places go below the frost line.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#howitworks #engineering #foundation #science #shorts",
